        "created_at": "2025-03-03T01:34:58.604Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>There is only one slot for SC oppe, there is no slot booking. However if you’re having an unavoidable commitment on 29th, please write a mail to the support team and cc the course instructors <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/subendu\">@Subendu</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/atulps\">@AtulPS</a> and ask for rescheduling to next week. This is not freely granted and requires a formal justification with attached documents for the same. They shall guide you for the same. However the second attempt might have a penalty and not be graded out of the full <span class=\"math\">100</span> marks. Do choose accordingly.</p>\n<p>Regards</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
