      "username": "anaskhan",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/anaskhan/{size}/158195_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-03-01T18:30:44.194Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I noticed in the grading document that the SC OPPE slot for March 29 is mentioned as 7 PM - 9 PM. However, I won’t be able to attend this slot due to Some Reasons.</p>\n<p>Will there be an option for slot booking for SC OPPE? What am I supposed to do now, Should I wait for the official slot announcement, or should I mail the support team now regarding a slot/date change?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "posts_count": 2,
      "updated_at": "2025-03-01T18:30:44.194Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
